WEBVTT

00:18:25.174 --> 00:18:32.174
(Music)

00:18:36.357 --> 00:18:38.285
(Music fades out)

00:18:41.325 --> 00:18:43.116
(Music)

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:47.476
It's not uncommon for people to say
"My coworkers feel like my family."

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:48.956
But I recently met someone

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.996
who takes that sentiment
to a whole new level.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.240
Jessica Clingman-Kerns: The DoubleTree
by Hilton Sonoma Wine Country

00:18:55.264 --> 00:18:56.433
is my second home.

00:18:56.457 --> 00:19:00.416
Everybody here is my family.